cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these workflows in your research, please cite this software repository."
title: "Pan-TE catalogue and multi-omics analysis workflows"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/wangc-bio/BT_PanTE_Multiomics_public"
abstract: >-
  Reusable computational workflows for constructing a transposable-element
  catalogue and analysing TE genomic occupancy, transcription, DNA methylation,
  chromatin accessibility, and cross-assay multi-omics associations in a
  diploid intergeneric hybrid fish system.
keywords:
  - transposable elements
  - Pan-TE
  - multi-omics
  - hybridization
  - fish genomics
